{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/1484476-9-and-8-again","id":1484476,"title":"9 and 8-again","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-06-19T22:32:59-07:00","id":1484476,"title":"9 and 8-again","content":"In both Hero and Demigod they state that 9 and 8-again doesn't change when you become a Demigod and your target number becomes 7.<br /> But I can't find any other reference to 8 or 9-again anywhere else.<br /> I know the -again rule is big in new WoD and it would make sense relics, knacks or boons would grant 9-again.<br /> But I can't find the rule used anywhere, am I just not looking the right place?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-21T05:20:01-07:00","id":1484602,"title":"","content":"Origin, page 63 under Rolling The Dice","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-22T04:32:57-07:00","id":1484693,"title":"","content":"Thanks, but I think you misunderstood me.<br /> On page 63 it explains how the 8- and 9-againg rule works, I'm looking for Knacks, Boons or Birthrights, that use the rule. Or any power for that matter.<br /> <br /> In Demigod, rolling defence with any Divinity Dice, grants 9-again, but that's all I can find.<br /> <br /> But if you would want 9-again on a Relic, how many dots would it be worth?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-22T05:43:54-07:00","id":1484696,"title":"","content":"Yeah, Scion has the rules for 8- and 9-again, but it VERY rarely uses it. I think Demigod is the first time it shows up in use. As for pricing for Relics, it's hard to value it since it depends on the numbers of dice you're rolling. Honestly, I'd probably just ignore it in favor of Enhancement. Enhancement is a lot cleaner and easier to price.<br /> <br /> ETA: 9-Again doesn't add a lot to a roll. In a 10-die pool with TN8, You're going from an average of 3.3 successes per roll to 3.6, very roughly. 1 enhancement is probably going to be worth more.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":8719,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","user":"Florin","date":". 06-22-2022, 01:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-22T23:52:50-07:00","id":1484760,"title":"","content":"That makes a lot of sense, thanks.<br /> I haven't considered the statistics of it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3356-kalle","name":"Kalle","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"30"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-06-23T05:51:48-07:00","id":1484767,"title":"","content":"No worries. So all of that is to say I'd value 8-again at about the same value as 1 enhancement with respect to Relic building.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8719-florin","name":"Florin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"940"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}